WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.890
<v Ashu>Good afternoon, and welcome to The House of 1400. It's Monday nineteen October, I'm Ashu, and we have editor T. A. Bhide's paper in front of us.

2
00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:19.930
<v Tarun>Hello everyone, I'm Tarun. It's a little after two in the afternoon here in Bengaluru, chai is poured, and Page One has some dramatic news.

3
00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:29.760
<v Ashu>Starting with alarming news from Mumbai. Gunmen fired into actor Tiger Shroff's car in Juhu on Sunday evening as he left football practice.

4
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.410
<v Tarun>Arre, Tiger Shroff? Was he hit?

5
00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.450
<v Ashu>He was not hit by a bullet, though he had bandages on his upper body. His driver and another person were injured.

6
00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.710
<v Tarun>Did the police catch who did it?

7
00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:48.700
<v Ashu>Rajasthan police detained three suspects on Monday: two who had lived in Mumbai, and a minor.

8
00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:56.460
<v Tarun>Shooting at a car crawling past a crowd in Juhu is terrifying, given Mumbai's history of targeting public figures.

9
00:00:56.460 --> 00:01:05.270
<v Ashu>It really is. On Page One, Washington and New Delhi seem on the verge of sealing a trade agreement, according to Marco Rubio.

10
00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:08.120
<v Tarun>What cleared the way after all the tariff threats?

11
00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:16.800
<v Ashu>The Russian oil waiver. Rubio said you cannot unravel an economy over one issue, and European allies had refused secondary tariffs.

12
00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:19.960
<v Tarun>And Rubio meets S. Jaishankar in Mumbai tomorrow?

13
00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:25.760
<v Ashu>Yes, on Tuesday, with the hundred per cent tariff threat lifted, removing the biggest friction point.

14
00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:30.180
<v Tarun>Did our stock market take a hit on Page One today?

15
00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:41.830
<v Ashu>Heavyweight private banks dragged things down after earnings. HDFC Bank fell around two per cent on margin concerns, and ICICI and Axis also slid.

16
00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:44.710
<v Tarun>Even with state-run banks doing well?

17
00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:53.200
<v Ashu>Union Bank and PNB gained about five per cent, but foreign selling pulled down index funds. We will get to the index figures in Money.

18
00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:57.250
<v Tarun>What is Anthropic doing with its shares on Page One?

19
00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:08.110
<v Ashu>Putting five per cent into a public benefit fund, rising towards twenty per cent as value grows, focusing on artificial intelligence's impact on jobs.

20
00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:11.920
<v Tarun>And Elon Musk said to just give the shares away directly!

21
00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:21.340
<v Ashu>He did! Page One also covers France, where Emmanuel Macron warned looters will pay after weekend protests saw twenty-four hundred arrests.

22
00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:26.610
<v Tarun>That is nearly the yellow vest record. What happened in News?

23
00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:37.240
<v Ashu>In News, a terrible peacetime accident in Canada. Four soldiers died in a fire during live-fire combat training at Base Wainwright in Alberta.

24
00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:40.030
<v Tarun>Didn't earlier reports say seven died?

25
00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:52.160
<v Ashu>Officials confirmed four: Sergeant Morgan Wong, Private Shaun Farrell, Private Aidan Goulding, and Private Hayden Lykkemark. Nineteen of thirty-nine injured are critical.

26
00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:55.360
<v Tarun>How did a grass fire reach live munitions?

27
00:02:55.360 --> 00:03:06.260
<v Ashu>The army is investigating. In Kolkata, seven people were sent to ten days of police custody over that Durga Puja crush that killed nineteen and injured twenty-five.

28
00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:10.530
<v Tarun>Close to Home here in Bengaluru, the Pink Line budget has shot up?

29
00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:20.330
<v Ashu>Doubled to over seventeen thousand crore rupees. The thirteen-point-eight kilometre underground stretch costs more than a thousand crore per kilometre.

30
00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:25.130
<v Tarun>That is tunnel road level, yaar. Any news back home in Ranchi?

31
00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:33.950
<v Ashu>Back home in Ranchi, a seventeen-year-old Class eleven student was found dead near Muri. Police suspect rape and strangulation.

32
00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:37.940
<v Tarun>Horrible. And back home in Prayagraj?

33
00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:48.780
<v Ashu>Four friends from Varanasi were killed on the Prayagraj-Varanasi highway near Rupapur. A speeding truck hit their SUV while they were parked on an overbridge taking selfies.

34
00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:57.220
<v Tarun>Heartbreaking. For Bengaluru weather today, it is warm at twenty-nine degrees, low of twenty, with a fair chance of rain later.

35
00:03:57.220 --> 00:04:11.250
<v Ashu>In Money, as of two o'clock, the Sensex was down one point two per cent so far today at seventy-three thousand eight hundred and four. It is up two point six per cent this week, but down under one per cent over the month.

36
00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.020
<v Tarun>How did Wall Street finish overnight?

37
00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:24.190
<v Ashu>Overnight in New York, the Nasdaq-one hundred fell two point five per cent to twenty-nine thousand one hundred and eighty-eight on tech selling, down five and a half per cent for the week.

38
00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:26.190
<v Tarun>And the currency and commodities?

39
00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:49.440
<v Ashu>The rupee weakened zero point four per cent today to ninety-four point nine three against the dollar. Twenty-four-carat gold is at one lakh forty-six thousand four hundred and ten rupees for ten grams, up zero point three per cent since Thursday, but down two per cent this week. Brent crude fell two point three per cent to one hundred and seven dollars thirty-eight cents.

40
00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:55.120
<v Tarun>Now for Sport! Real Madrid beat Sevilla four-one at the Bernabéu!

41
00:04:55.120 --> 00:05:01.950
<v Ashu>And without Vinícius! Arda Güler scored first, and Kylian Mbappé had a brace?

42
00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:12.760
<v Tarun>Haan, an open play goal and a penalty he won himself, eleven goals in eleven games! Yan Diomande stepped in for Vinícius, assisted Güler, and scored the fourth.

43
00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:15.490
<v Ashu>Where does that leave Madrid in the table?

44
00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:27.350
<v Tarun>Third on twenty-one points, six behind Barcelona before Sunday's Clásico. Dean Huijsen completed nearly ninety-seven per cent of his passes, though Güler got sent off late on.

45
00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:42.000
<v Ashu>Barcelona visit PSG on Wednesday in the Champions League. In the Premier League, Noni Madueke gave Arsenal a one-nil win at Nottingham Forest, while Manchester United drew one-all at Leeds.

46
00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:46.330
<v Tarun>And how did India do at the Asian Para Games in Nagoya?

47
00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:58.620
<v Ashu>A stunning one-two! Mona Agarwal came from sixth to snatch gold in the ten-metre air rifle with a Games record of two hundred and fifty point zero, beating Avani Lekhara by zero point four points!

48
00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:05.070
<v Tarun>And Avani's silver seals a quota for the twenty twenty-eight Paralympics! Brilliant.

49
00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:14.620
<v Ashu>In basketball, Golden State beat Portland one hundred and twenty-eight to one hundred and eighteen on Saturday. And India's fifth T20 against West Indies here was washed out.

50
00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:25.200
<v Tarun>Time for Fixture Watch! Madrid host RB Leipzig in the Champions League on Thursday at twelve thirty a m, late on Wednesday night. Then Lakers play Golden State on Thursday at seven thirty a m.

51
00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:38.460
<v Ashu>India face New Zealand in Christchurch on Thursday at twelve thirty p m. On Saturday, Golden State play Memphis Grizzlies at seven thirty a m, and India play New Zealand again at twelve thirty p m.

52
00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:50.180
<v Tarun>Formula One heads to the United States Grand Prix on Sunday, where Max Verstappen sits fourth in the championship on two hundred and twenty-one points, a hundred and nineteen behind Kimi Antonelli.

53
00:06:50.180 --> 00:07:00.920
<v Ashu>In tennis, Carlos Alcaraz is at the Vienna Open from Monday twenty-six October, and Novak Djokovic takes a wild card in Basel from twenty-four October.

54
00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:02.700
<v Tarun>What is showing in the Betting Window?

55
00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:11.570
<v Ashu>Harry Kane is favourite for the Ballon d'Or with about a two-in-three chance, and Barcelona are given around an eighty-two per cent chance to win the league in twenty twenty-seven.

56
00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:14.240
<v Tarun>What is coming up in The Week Ahead?

57
00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:26.050
<v Ashu>Japan's Phobos mission launches tomorrow at one eleven a m, late tonight. Then Rubio in Mumbai tomorrow, and the thirty-thousand-crore Jio Platforms IPO opening Wednesday.

58
00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:29.320
<v Tarun>And that brings us to Bhide's House Note!

59
00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:37.820
<v Ashu>Bhide noted all the day's heavy headlines, but his true takeaway was simple: Madrid won without Vinícius.

60
00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:40.610
<v Tarun>Priorities sorted, ekdum!

61
00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:45.350
<v Ashu>That's The House of 1400 for today. Same time tomorrow, same chai.
